To improve the TG, we can combine these tasks into a single task that calculates both coordinates at once. Here’s an updated version of the TG:

```json
{
    "owner_agent": "ProbStat",
    "tasks": {
        "CalculateMidpointXY": "Calculate the x- and y-coordinates of the midpoint between two points."
    },
    "orders": [
        {
            "condition": "success",
            "from": "CalculateMidpointXY",
            "to": "End"
        }
    ],
    "refused": false,
    "answer": null
}
```

This change ensures that both coordinates are computed in parallel, optimizing the workflow.
